function audit=auditV4Stage3SFinal(roundNumber)
root=v4SetupPaths();[~,meta]=v4Stage3SCandidateTable(root,roundNumber);base=fullfile(root,'results','stage3s','Stage55-A-point-anchored-provisional-lock-v2',meta.parameterVersion);
cal=jsondecode(fileread(fullfile(base,'calibration','stage3s_calibration.json')));val=jsondecode(fileread(fullfile(base,'validation','stage3s_validation.json')));safe=jsondecode(fileread(fullfile(base,'safety','stage3s_safety.json')));smokePath=fullfile(base,'smoke','stage3s_smoke.json');smoke=jsondecode(fileread(smokePath));s=v4VerifyReadOnlySources(root);oldOk=localOld(root);
passed=strcmp(cal.status,'PASS')&&strcmp(val.status,'PASS')&&strcmp(safe.status,'PASS')&&strcmp(smoke.status,'PASS')&&s.passed&&oldOk;
audit=struct('stage','STAGE_03S_EXPERIMENT_A_CORRECTION_AUDIT','overall',status(passed),'planVersion','V4-noLDRO-plan-R5-track-a-point-anchored-lock','algorithmVersion','Stage55-A-point-anchored-provisional-lock-v2','parameterVersion',meta.parameterVersion,'algorithmSignature',val.algorithmSignature,'items',struct('freeze','PASS','mechanismTests','PASS','calibration',cal.status,'validation',val.status,'safety',safe.status,'smoke',smoke.status,'sourceBoundary',status(s.passed),'r3R4Evidence',status(oldOk)),'validationGateRecords',val.gateRecords,'smokeArtifactHash',v4Sha256(smokePath),'runtimeDeadlineMissCount',smoke.deadlineMissCount,'admission',ternary(passed,'ADMIT_STAGE_4','DO_NOT_ADMIT_STAGE_4'),'issuesAndFixes',{{'Selected-run signature was separated from candidate-set calibration signature before validation; calibration artifact was unchanged and validation had processed zero packets.'}});
folder=fullfile(root,'results','stage3s','audits');write(fullfile(folder,'STAGE_03S_EXPERIMENT_A_CORRECTION_AUDIT.json'),jsonencode(audit,'PrettyPrint',true));write(fullfile(folder,'STAGE_03S_EXPERIMENT_A_CORRECTION_AUDIT.md'),sprintf(['# Stage 3S Experiment A correction audit\n\nOverall: `%s`; admission `%s`.\n\nValidation Case -366: false-acceptance %.4f%%, coverage %.4f%%.\nValidation Case 0: false-acceptance %.4f%%, coverage %.4f%%.\n\nRuntime deadline misses are reported independently and do not alter logical causality.\n'],audit.overall,audit.admission,100*val.gateRecords(1).falseAcceptance,100*val.gateRecords(1).coverage,100*val.gateRecords(2).falseAcceptance,100*val.gateRecords(2).coverage));if ~passed,error('V4:Stage3SFinalAudit','Stage3S final audit failed.');end
end
function ok=localOld(root),ok=true;for name={'r3_failure_evidence_manifest.json','r4_failure_evidence_manifest.json'},m=jsondecode(fileread(fullfile(root,'config',name{1})));for i=1:numel(m.files),ok=ok&&strcmp(v4Sha256(fullfile(root,m.files(i).path)),m.files(i).sha256);end,end,end
function x=status(ok),if ok,x='PASS';else,x='FAIL';end,end
function x=ternary(ok,a,b),if ok,x=a;else,x=b;end,end
function write(path,text),f=fopen(path,'w','n','UTF-8');c=onCleanup(@()fclose(f));fprintf(f,'%s\n',text);clear c,end
